  "system": {
    "identifier": "ranton-storm-release-laser-beam",
    "description": "<p>You conjure a beam of Lightning and Water that bends around corners and piercing its targets with lethal efficiency. Draw a 60-foot long, 5-foot-wide line, originating from you. This line can change directions turn corners and move diagonally. Creatures that this beam passes through must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d8 Lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much on a success.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and damage by 1d8.</p>",
